{\*\htmltag244 <ID ID="Quick Flags Description">}If you need to respond to an e-mail message but you don\'92t have the time now, you can click on the flag icon next to it to mark it with a Quick Flag. Multiple colored flags make it easy to categorize your messages. The folder named "For Follow Up" always contains an up-to-date list of all Quick Flagged messages in every folder in your mailbox.
